<?xml version="1.0"?><IG xmlns="" version="1.0" streamversion="202609071419" exeversion="15.0.0 Build 57607" project="EU-Rent.prjx" Server="" Namespace="{01A04730-A282-7946-B9FB-59CB9660256D}" ItemVersion="0" Locale="en-US" ModelValidatedOn="2026-09-07T16:35:15.112" ModelValidatedErrors="0" ModelValidatedWarnings="0" ModelValidatedHints="0"><INFO><Description></Description><Author></Author><File></File><Name>eu-rent</Name><Project>EU-Rent.prjx</Project><CreatedOn>2026-08-28T09:06:04.455</CreatedOn><UpdatedOn>2026-09-07T18:32:12.615</UpdatedOn></INFO><TABLE Name="OTFT"><META><COLUMN Name="OTFT Name" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Alias" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Type" Type="CHARACTER" Width="1"/><COLUMN Name="Derivable?" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Subtype?" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Data Type" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Length" Type="INTEGER"/><COLUMN Name="Scale" Type="INTEGER"/><COLUMN Name="Reducable?" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Reduce!" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Comment" Type="CHARACTER" Width="1024"/><COLUMN Name="SyncLink" Type="CHARACTER" Width="38"/><COLUMN Name="Artificial Key" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Estimated number of Tuples" Type="INTEGER"/><COLUMN Name="Static population" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Namespace" Type="CHARACTER" Width="38"/><COLUMN Name="NamespaceVersion" Type="INTEGER"/><COLUMN Name="Is super type" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Is abstract type" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="OTFT Schema" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Abbreviation" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="OTFT Plural" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Temporal" Type="CHARACTER" Width="35"/><COLUMN Name="Transitional" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Concept Type" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Task Status" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Task Color" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Task Background" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Localize Value" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Image URI" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Meta Level" Type="CHARACTER" Width="1"/><COLUMN Name="Authoritative Synclink" Type="CHARACTER" Width="38"/><COLUMN Name="Case Sensitive" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Annotatable" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="IsComplexType" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="OTFT Article" Type="CHARACTER" Width="20"/><COLUMN Name="IsComposite" Type="BOOLEAN"/><COLUMN Name="Sensitivity" Type="CHARACTER" Width="20"/><COLUMN Name="Retention Policy" Type="CHARACTER" Width="20"/><COLUMN Name="Created By" Type="CHARACTER" Width="128"/><COLUMN Name="Created On" Type="anyType"/><COLUMN Name="Updated By" Type="CHARACTER" Width="128"/><COLUMN Name="Updated On" Type="anyType"/></META><DATA><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">1. Business Context</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">P</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Paragraph]
EU-Rent is a fictitious car rental company that has become the standard worked example for business vocabulary and business rules. It operates in several countries. In each country it has local areas, and each local area contains branches. EU-Rent rents cars to customers from branches, and one-way rentals - picked up at one branch and dropped off at another - are allowed. Each car is of a given car model; car models are grouped into car groups, and all cars in a car group carry the same rental tariff. Cars are serviced at 5000 mile intervals. EU-Rent records "bad experiences" with drivers - police actions, unpaid fines, damage, late or non-return - and may bar the drivers who cause them.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A0473A-732C-77E9-83B0-C2BF26C7D30E</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type">Book</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A0473A-732C-708B-A6F7-A89CA562B2C2</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091648.044</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">2. Scope Of This Model</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">P</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Paragraph]
This information model covers the five subject areas held in the containers of this repository: the Network (Country, Local Area, Branch), the Fleet (Car Group, Car Model, Car, condition, odometer, service), the Parties (Person with its Customer and Driver subtypes, licences, bad experiences, barring), the Rental Process (the rental, its period, its allocated car, its drivers and its state) and Charging (the tariff per car group per country, and the charges a rental incurs). Out of scope: reservations inventory and availability forecasting, accident and insurance claim handling, invoicing and payment settlement, and the loyalty scheme that later versions of the case add.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A0473A-8101-7AA4-B27E-7F5C1C7FD65E</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type">Book</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A0473A-8101-75D9-A9CD-21177BEB8392</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091651.585</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">3. How To Read This Model</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">P</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Paragraph]
The model is built fact-first, in FCO-IM style: every fact type carries one expression in natural language, and the object and label types emerge from the roles in those expressions. Identification is stated with uniqueness constraints, not with keys: an object type is identified by the roles it plays under a UC. Car Model shows a composite identification - the UC spans manufacturer AND model name together. Mandatory participation is stated with totality constraints. Enumerations and life cycles are stated with value constraints: Car Group Code is a labelled enumeration, while Condition and Rental Status are state machines whose transitions say which state may follow which. The twenty business rules R01-R20 live as separate rule types; each says in its [Definition] whether the model already enforces it structurally or whether it needs a derivation expression.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A0473A-9481-7139-9D67-36D49D331CCC</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type">Book</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A0473A-9481-781F-B338-F8021A73E37F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091656.577</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">4. Modelling Decisions</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">P</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Paragraph]
Four decisions are worth knowing. First, renter and driver are separated: Person is the supertype and Customer and Driver are subtypes, because a company may rent a car it never drives, and a driver may drive on someone else's contract. Second, the tariff hangs off Car Group and Country, never off Car or Car Model - that is what makes "all cars in a car group have the same tariff" true by construction rather than by rule. Third, the rental life cycle is carried by a state-machine value constraint rather than by separate date facts, so the legal transitions are visible in one place. Fourth, One-Way Rental, Advance Rental, Walk-in Rental and Open Rental are subtypes of Rental that are DERIVED - they follow from comparing branches, dates or state - and so they carry no facts of their own.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A0473A-A496-7C50-9029-902694C03E3D</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type">Book</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A0473A-A496-7F94-AD54-79D42FFAAC60</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091700.694</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">5. Sources</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">P</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Paragraph]
The oldest source of the case is the GUIDE Business Rules Project final report "Defining Business Rules ~ What Are They Really?" by the Business Rules Group (first published as a GUIDE publication in 1995, revised 1997, revision 1.3 July 2000; https://www.businessrulesgroup.org/first_paper/BRG-whatisBR_3ed.pdf ). Its Appendix D, "Case Study: EU-Rent Car Rentals", was developed by Model Systems Ltd. of the United Kingdom (example by John Hall) and may be copied freely if its source is acknowledged. That original describes EU-Rent as one of three businesses of EU-Corporation (with EU-Fly and EU-Stay), with 1000 branches, service depots serving several branches each, cars sold at one year old or 40,000 km, and the rules that a customer has only one car on rental at a time and that the signing driver must not currently have an EU-Rent car out. The case later became the annex of the OMG SBVR specification. The material this model was actually built from is the SBVR-era retelling: the EU-Rent example page at https://kdmanalytics.com/sbvr/EU-Rent.html ; the SBVR introduction with the sample rules at https://kdmanalytics.com/sbvr/sbvr_intro_2.html ; the EU-Rent case description at https://caminao.blog/community/sample-problems/eu-rent-car/ ; and "SBVR Speaks on Rules: Violations of Business Rules" at https://www.brcommunity.com/articles.php?id=c009 , from which the Area of Usage Rule and its remedial rule are quoted verbatim. Where the sources leave a detail open - the exact bad-experience threshold, the minimum driver age, the 90-day cap - the model states a plausible value and says so in the rule's annotation.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A0473A-BCC3-7BA0-B249-54F7E79DE856</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type">Book</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A0473A-BCC3-7E3F-A5C2-4FCB1F5CC84F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091706.883</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260907 182643.603</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Actual Return</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04732-17BC-7CAB-B764-570C4BEC9BC7</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><