k Status">Develop</FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A04732-109B-77FC-8391-8E1A82933EEC</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090738.523</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">EU-Rent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">C</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
A fictitious car rental company used as the standard worked example for business vocabulary and business rules. It operates in several countries; each country has local areas containing branches; it rents cars to customers from branches; one-way rentals are allowed; each car is of a given model and models are grouped into car groups sharing a tariff.
[Source]
Originally developed by Model Systems Ltd. of the United Kingdom (example by John Hall) as Appendix D "Case Study: EU-Rent Car Rentals" of the GUIDE Business Rules Project final report "Defining Business Rules ~ What Are They Really?" (Business Rules Group; first published 1995, revised 1997 and July 2000; https://www.businessrulesgroup.org/first_paper/BRG-whatisBR_3ed.pdf ). Later adopted as the case study of the OMG SBVR specification (EU-Rent Annex). Overviews used for this model: https://kdmanalytics.com/sbvr/EU-Rent.html , https://kdmanalytics.com/sbvr/sbvr_intro_2.html , https://caminao.blog/community/sample-problems/eu-rent-car/ , https://www.brcommunity.com/articles.php?id=c009</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A07226-E566-7C62-BE5A-E3D21466B7C0</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260905 171906.854</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">mcp-agent</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260907 182647.359</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">EU-Rent Business Rules</FIE