T Name">One-Way Rental</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
A rental whose drop-off branch differs from its pick-up branch. Subtype of Rental, derived rather than asserted: it follows from comparing the two Branch roles. It attracts a location penalty charge (R09).
[Derivation]
One-Way Rental := Rental R WHERE Pick Up Branch[R].Branch &lt;&gt; Drop Off Branch[R].Branch. Never asserted: it follows from the two Branch roles (R09).</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04735-4AC4-78F9-B4C9-C787AD1854C9</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A04735-4AC4-787E-8200-9691A18E3473</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091110.020</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260905 173416.445</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Open Rental</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
A rental that has been picked up but not yet returned - state Open. The subject of the Area of Usage Rule (R10): only an open rental has a car out on the road that can leave its authorized area.
[Source]
"open rental" is used as a term in the SBVR EU-Rent rule statements quoted at https://www.brcommunity.com/articles.php?id=c009
[Derivation]
Open Rental := Rental R WHERE Rental State[R].Rental Status = 'Open'. Never asserted: it follows from the state (R10, R11).</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04735-4BA6-7F56-B624-D6BDA9DEF474</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A04735-4BA6-7ABE-945F-2AA5CE73A521</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091110.246</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260905 173416.461</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Person</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">N</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">[Definition]
A human being known to EU-Rent. Person is the supertype: the same person may be a customer, a driver, or both. Every person must be at least one of the two - a totality constraint spans the Customer and Driver roles.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04731-CF99-7C08-9115-C96DDFFF767E</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type">T</FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A04731-CF99-7F54-A999-5258B9DE7ED9</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090721.881</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260828 091840.496</FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="OTFT Name">Person Name</FIELD><FIELD Name="Alias"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Type">L</FIELD><FIELD Name="Derivable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Subtype?">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Data Type">string</FIELD><FIELD Name="Length"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Scale"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reducable?"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Reduce!"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment"></FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04731-D112-7B73-9FDC-CD3D1EF438EF</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of T