A rental contracted at the branch counter on the pick-up date itself, with no prior booking. Subtype of Rental. It goes straight to state Open, skipping the Requested state.
[Derivation]
Walk-in Rental := Rental R WHERE Rental State[R] entered 'Open' without ever having been 'Requested' - i.e. the rental was contracted on Rental Period[R].Pick Up Date itself. Needs the state history (transaction time on Rental State) to be evaluated exactly; approximated as NOT Advance Rental at the moment of contracting.</FIELD><FIELD Name="SyncLink">01A04735-4951-7994-B985-D7EE656AFAFE</FIELD><FIELD Name="Artificial Key"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Estimated number of Tuples"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Static population">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is super type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Is abstract type">F</FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Schema"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Abbreviation"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Plural"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Temporal"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Transitional"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Concept Type"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Status"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Color"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Task Background"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Localize Value"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Image URI"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Meta Level">1</FIELD><FIELD Name="Authoritative Synclink">01A04735-4951-7A4B-BD56-EFC9460C73E6</FIELD><FIELD Name="Case Sensitive"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Annotatable"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComplexType"></FIELD><FIELD Name="OTFT Article"></FIELD><FIELD Name="IsComposite"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Sensitivity"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Retention Policy"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 091109.649</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On">20260905 173416.429</FIELD></ROW></DATA></TABLE><TABLE Name="Locale_OTFT"><META><COLUMN Name="OTFT Name" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="OTFT Schema" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Locale" Type="CHARACTER" Width="64"/><COLUMN Name="Locale_OTFT Name" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Locale_Alias" Type="CHARACTER" Width="254"/><COLUMN Name="Locale_Comment" Type="CHARACTER" Width="1024