="Comment">Rental life cycle: an advance booking is Requested, becomes Open at pick-up, Closed at return; it may be Cancelled before or during the rental (SBVR EU-Rent remedial rule on Area of Usage).</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090923.137</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="VC No.">3</FIELD><FIELD Name="LOT">Bad Experience Kind</FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Kinds of bad experience EU-Rent records against a driver; enough bad experiences bar the driver.</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090924.393</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="VC No.">4</FIELD><FIELD Name="LOT">Charge Kind</FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">Charge kinds a rental can incur.</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090926.502</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW><ROW><FIELD Name="VC No.">5</FIELD><FIELD Name="LOT">Car Group Code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Comment">EU-Rent car groups, in ascending tariff order. The order matters: an upgrade must be to a HIGHER group.</FIELD><FIELD Name="Namespace"></FIELD><FIELD Name="NamespaceVersion"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Created By">claude-code</FIELD><FIELD Name="Created On">20260828 090927.720</FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated By"></FIELD><FIELD Name="Updated On"></FIELD></ROW></DATA></TABLE><TABLE Name="Locale_VC"><META><COLUMN Name="VC No." Type="INTEGER"/><COLUMN Name="Locale" Type="CHARACTER" Width="64"/><COLUMN Name="Locale_Comment" Type="CHARACTER" Width="1024"/></META><DATA/></TABLE><TABLE Name="VC Value(s)"><META><COLUMN Name="VC" Type="INTEGER"/><COLU